# Empty-by-design fixture data root for the Ren'Py testcases harness.
#
# The mod's CueDatabase.open() creates every required subdir (data/, music/,
# video/, ...) at init, so an empty root boots cleanly -- the smoke testcases
# never read real media. CI points RENPY_CUE_DIR here (see .github/workflows/
# ci.yml). Future testcases that exercise real files commit them under this
# directory.
